                    config MAIA_SSD1306_NUM_PAGES
                        int "Number of display pages"
                        default 3
                        range 1 10
                        help
                            Total number of virtual screens/pages
                            available for cycling through different
                            information displays.
                            
                            Typical usage:
                              Page 0: Splash (animal/tutor info)
